    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so heavy lately. being here, in this house, watching the dust settle on things that used to matter... it feels like i'm just waiting for the end of a long, tired story. the silence is so much kinder than the noise of actually living. i just want to drift away into the grey and never have to feel this weight again.",
